<title>UK: BOXING-HARDY KEEPS EUROPEAN CROWN.</title>
<headline>BOXING-HARDY KEEPS EUROPEAN CROWN.</headline>
<dateline>SUNDERLAND, England 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Billy Hardy retained his European featherweight title on Monday when he outpointed fellow Briton Steve Robinson.</p>
